{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":152910,"duration_api_ms":172987,"num_turns":11,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"95967c97-f95b-4677-bac5-bb79587b531b","total_cost_usd":0.6336596000000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":37756,"cache_read_input_tokens":272147,"output_tokens":2761,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":37756,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":2971,"outputTokens":9026,"cacheReadInputTokens":730426,"cacheCreationInputTokens":57114,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.1925361,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":10,"outputTokens":2761,"cacheReadInputTokens":272147,"cacheCreationInputTokens":37756,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.4411235,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"evidence":["All tank_core tests pass: 0 failures across all 15 test binaries (approx. 196 tests total). clippy clean, fmt clean.","Action model correctly split: PlayerAction::TrimPlantsAndRemove (export, biomass exits system) and PlayerAction::TrimPlantsAndLeaveCuttings (detritus routing, closed-system) defined in actions.rs:13-18.","Engine handling verified: engine.rs:600-619 exports biomass for Remove variant; engine.rs:620-642 routes to fine_detritus for LeaveCuttings variant. Budget labels correctly assigned at engine.rs:791-792.","Event log/UI text distinguishes the two actions: TUI shows 'Trim & remove' with hint '(exported)' vs 'Trim & leave' with hint '(to detritus)' in crates/tank_tui/src/screens/actions.rs.","Budget instrumentation: Remove variant uses snapshot-delta recording (open-system), explicitly documented in engine.rs:616-617 comment. Budget guard recognizes the label as open-system.","Unit test coverage: test_trim_plants_and_remove_exports_n_and_c (budget_tracking.rs:654-703) asserts total N/C decreases by exactly the exported amount within 1e-6 tolerance.","Unit test coverage: test_trim_plants_and_leave_cuttings_preserves_n_and_c (budget_tracking.rs:624-651) asserts total N/C is conserved within 1e-6 tolerance.","Legacy migration test: legacy_schema_v4_saves_migrate_trim_plants_to_trim_and_remove (save_load.rs:416-497) verifies old TrimPlants actions migrate to TrimPlantsAndRemove with correct fractions.","Integration test: test_weekly_trim_and_remove_exports_nutrients_over_500_hours (budget_tracking.rs:1433-1539) confirms cumulative export matches total N decrease over 500 simulated hours.","SUB_ADULT_FEEDING_WEIGHT unified: single definition at biology.rs:149 (value 0.67, pub(crate)), re-exported via types/mod.rs:24, imported by shrimp.rs:7. No duplicate definitions remain.","Stale trim tests fixed: budget_helpers.rs now tests TrimPlantsAndLeaveCuttings with label 'action:trim_plants_and_leave_cuttings'; plant_algae_integration.rs now tests TrimPlantsAndLeaveCuttings for detritus routing."],"findings_or_gaps":["No gaps found against acceptance criteria. All seven criteria are met: (1) action model distinguishes export vs in-tank decay, (2) event log/UI text reflects distinction, (3) budget instrumentation treats export as intentional removal, (4) unit test for Remove reducing N/C by exported amount, (5) unit test for LeaveCuttings conserving N/C, (6) legacy save migration test, (7) 500-hour integration test.","Amendment fixes from final review round 1 are properly applied: feeding weight unification (fr-1-2857eb23), budget_helpers test correction (fr-1-b5357512 / fr-1-264c0ac6), and plant_algae_integration test correction (fr-1-f4085f8d)."],"follow_up_or_amendments":[],"outcome":"approved"},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"d6a31495-7513-4950-8f9a-0c59ef756820"}
